{"ref":"BDB, זָעַף","hw":"זָעַף","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָעַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be out of humour, vexed; be enraged (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܥܰܦ</span> <em>rage against</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְעַף</span> <em>to storm</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲפָא</span> <em>storm;</em> cf. Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠆࠏࠐ</span><em>blow, breathe</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְעַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.3\">Pr 19:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזְעַף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַעְפּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹעֲפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:6\" href=\"/Genesis.40.6\">Gn 40:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>be out of humour</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:6\" href=\"/Genesis.40.6\">Gn 40:6</a> (E); <em>dejected</em>, of face <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.3\">Pr 19:3</a> <em>fret against</em> (AV). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>be enraged</em> (late: cf. Aramaic above) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">19</a>.","next":"BDB, זַ֫עַף","prev":"BDB, זַ֫עַם"}